## [Core concepts](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/organizing-your-aws-environment/core-concepts.md)

- [AWS Organizations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/organizing-your-aws-environment/aws-organizations.md): AWS Organizations helps you centrally govern your environment as you grow and scale your workloads on AWS.
- [Benefits of using OUs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/organizing-your-aws-environment/benefits-of-using-organizational-units-ous.md): The following benefits of using OUs helped shape the Recommended OUs and accounts.
- [Multiple organizations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/organizing-your-aws-environment/multiple-organizations.md): Most customers are best served using a single production organization and a test organization.


